    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fCHECK THIS OUT!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>NEXT COMING\uff1a<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/9b1db61930bb0954f74a369c7e091ab5.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/1a7cc9372010b5f0bb7b9ca29e58db35.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br>\u25c6Story\u25c6<br>With the newfound peace between humans and demons, you've decided to open a bar with your lieutenants: Dora the Dragon Princess and Tio the Fox.<br><br>The doors open at night to welcome all sorts of customers. Rub shoulders with the Royal Guard, possessed archers, ancient goddesses, slutty sorceresses, vampire detectives, mermaids, and more! <br><br>Take their orders, listen to their stories and try to find the right drink for everyone. <br><br>Watch out for those who want to destroy your bar... or get into your pants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/25dee63800a28bbbaf601890f9acc952.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br>\u25c6Gameplay\u25c6<br>As the charming demon bartender, you'll have to make drinks based on your customers' requests. Earn tips based on customer satisfaction!<br><br>Alternatively, you can also try getting them really drunk. Who knows what'll happen?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/794730bf9d977e547d29e77bdfeaa7e6.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br>\u25c6Features\u25c6<br>\u25c730 beautiful H-CG scenes tailored for your pleasure.<br>\u25c7One-handed play to free up that other hand!<br>\u25c7Live out your bartender dreams with our immersive cocktail mixing minigame!<br>\u25c7Choose from eleven beautiful tracks by Pykamia to play as you schmooze and booze up your guests.<br>\u25c7An ensemble cast of 15 adorable characters just waiting for you to mix the right drink for them!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/00ced88edf51396a59a72b0f72f3b010.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>NEXT COMING\uff1a<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/9b1db61930bb0954f74a369c7e091ab5.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/1a7cc9372010b5f0bb7b9ca29e58db35.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br>\u25c6Story\u25c6<br>With the newfound peace between humans and demons, you've decided to open a bar with your lieutenants: Dora the Dragon Princess and Tio the Fox.<br><br>The doors open at night to welcome all sorts of customers. Rub shoulders with the Royal Guard, possessed archers, ancient goddesses, slutty sorceresses, vampire detectives, mermaids, and more! <br><br>Take their orders, listen to their stories and try to find the right drink for everyone. <br><br>Watch out for those who want to destroy your bar... or get into your pants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/25dee63800a28bbbaf601890f9acc952.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br>\u25c6Gameplay\u25c6<br>As the charming demon bartender, you'll have to make drinks based on your customers' requests. Earn tips based on customer satisfaction!<br><br>Alternatively, you can also try getting them really drunk. Who knows what'll happen?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/794730bf9d977e547d29e77bdfeaa7e6.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div><br><br>\u25c6Features\u25c6<br>\u25c730 beautiful H-CG scenes tailored for your pleasure.<br>\u25c7One-handed play to free up that other hand!<br>\u25c7Live out your bartender dreams with our immersive cocktail mixing minigame!<br>\u25c7Choose from eleven beautiful tracks by Pykamia to play as you schmooze and booze up your guests.<br>\u25c7An ensemble cast of 15 adorable characters just waiting for you to mix the right drink for them!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854250/extras/00ced88edf51396a59a72b0f72f3b010.avif?t=1750385873\" /></div>",
